 "notes": "Relic forge modal: header band (anvil emblem, gold 'Relic Forge' title in Cinzel with tall R/F, castle art on the right, gold 1,240 and shard 18 plaques, red close button) over a body frame with three framed columns, each topped by a section header bar (icon + Crimson bold title + Cinzel caps subtitle; Craft has no subtitle and its bar is shorter, 55 tall, ending at x=1210). Dismantle: 4x4 relic grid in a scroll viewport (dismantle.grid); slot.0 is SELECTED (glowing gold frame, slightly larger than the others, check badge top-left, no corner diamond). Frame colour per slot is given in each slot's 'frame' (blue = rare, purple = epic, grey = common). Every unselected slot has a small empty grey diamond in its bottom-right corner (~5 px in from the right edge, ~6 px up from the bottom). Row 3 is CLIPPED by the viewport at y=549 (full slots are 78 tall; slot rects there are the visible part); only slot.12's diamond is partly visible. Fuse: three blue-framed sockets all holding the same blue-gem pendant, each with a filled gold diamond pip straddling the bottom edge at centre and an empty grey diamond in its bottom-right corner, sitting on a dark ledge (base). A glowing gold bracket joins the three socket bottoms (y 341-344) and a centre stem with a down arrow points at the result socket (gold glowing frame, larger, pendant with radiant glow) above a pip plate showing 1 filled gold + 4 empty diamonds (the 4th empty diamond is drawn faded/overlapping the 3rd in the concept; space them evenly). Craft: recipe list column (craft.list) with five recipe slots; recipe.1 is SELECTED (orange glow) with caption 'Iron Pendant'; recipes 2-5 have plain dark-steel frames and no captions. Preview well shows 'Iron Pendant' title over a forge-workbench illustration; cost bar 150 gold + 3 shards. Action buttons Dismantle/Fuse/Craft are gold plates with dark-brown Cinzel labels (tall first letter + small caps) and dark icons left of the label; ARMORY and BACK TO MAP are navy plates with gold rivets, cream full-caps labels and gold icons, sitting outside the body frame below it. No disabled states are shown. The three section titles (Dismantle/Fuse/Craft, fitted 34/35/32) and the three action labels (21/22/22) are one style each in the concept; use a single size per style (~34 and ~22). The cost '3' uses the same size as '150' (single glyph, not width-fitted)."
